    "text": "A box of April 2012 with three promos and three booster packs: reverse holofoil Thundurus BW41 and Tornadus BW42 and a full art Landorus BW43. 5ban Graphics' art for all three first came in Japan in the Battle Gift Set: Thundurus vs Tornadus, a box of two ready-made decks released in November 2011. Thundurus and Tornadus reprint their Emerging Powers cards with that new art, and the full art Landorus, a reprint of Noble Victories' Landorus, gave it a full art card like those Thundurus and Tornadus already had.",
